    <h2>What one extra call a week is worth</h2>
    <p>Calls are what pay for a website. In a worked example for a typical local business, a $500 average job and one extra call a week come to $26,000 a year in potential work. At $5,000 a job, it's 10 times that. For a business that depends on local search, that gap outweighs the platform's monthly bill. You never see it, because it's the customers who never called.</p>

